{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16013","headline":"捣衣曲 · 王建","name":"捣衣曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月明中庭捣衣石，掩帷下堂来捣帛。\n妇姑相对神力生，双揎白腕调杵声。\n高楼敲玉节会成，家家不睡皆起听。\n秋天丁丁复冻冻，玉钗低昂衣带动。\n夜深月落冷如刀，湿着一双纤手痛。\n回编易裂看生熟，鸳鸯纹成水波曲。\n重烧熨斗帖两头，与郎裁作迎寒裘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16013.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16013","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}